tars">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <button style="background: lightblue; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px;">\n    In den Warenkorb\n  </button>\n  \n  <a href="#details" style="color: blue;">Mehr</a>\n</div>\n```\n\n**CSS-Kontext:**\n```css\n.product-card { cursor: pointer; }\n/* Note: Focus styles removed because client didn\'t like the outline */\n/* :focus { outline: none; } */\n```\n\n### Anforderungen an die Antwort:\n1. Erstelle eine **Markdown-Tabelle** mit allen gefundenen Issues.\n2. Gib für jedes Issue folgende Spalten an: \n   - **WCAG-Kriterium** (z.B. 1.1.1)\n   - **Beschreibung**\n   - **Schweregrad**\n   - **Lösung/Code-Snippet**'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-2024-05-13', 'temperature': 0.1}}
